red.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/3cd54d8bc99e97d71efa24049e0306f3.poster.avif?t=1754855117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/3cd54d8bc99e97d71efa24049e0306f3.webm?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/3cd54d8bc99e97d71efa24049e0306f3.mp4?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>physics-based game</strong>. Do you like playing with <strong>ragdolls</strong>? Then you've come to the right place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is full of <strong>secret chests</strong> to find, where you can unlock <strong>cosmetic items</strong> (masks, hats, etc.), <strong>ammunition</strong> for your weapons, and other <strong>power-ups</strong>. A special chest will allow you to <strong>grow</strong> or <strong>shrink</strong> (and offers new gameplay possibilities), and other surprises to discover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For collectors, <strong>24 magazines</strong> featuring the hero are hidden in the game. <strong>Dozens of lost bees</strong> that you must return to their 5-star hive. And don't forget the <strong>virus</strong> that's spread across the island: <strong>destroy them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/4c7d6f6ad80460d896c79099a1f11dcd.webp?t=1754855117\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has its share of <strong>puzzles</strong>, <strong>inaccessible areas</strong>,\u00a0and various <strong>parkours</strong> that you'll have to challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/e65e8f0406bf727832d761cf12b81d72.poster.avif?t=1754855117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/e65e8f0406bf727832d761cf12b81d72.webm?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/e65e8f0406bf727832d761cf12b81d72.mp4?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a <strong>time trial</strong> enthusiast? Grab your <strong>remote-controlled car</strong> and speed around the island, don't hesitate to <strong>wreck</strong> everything along the way :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/bdf93c10bb3a9d15a421cbe162a63cee.poster.avif?t=1754855117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/bdf93c10bb3a9d15a421cbe162a63cee.webm?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/bdf93c10bb3a9d15a421cbe162a63cee.mp4?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/88d659be91482b9b3b378b4891ff0cac.webp?t=1754855117\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are also part of the game, so it's up to you to find their weak points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/9790821fde97c98a82ca7426ae91986b.poster.avif?t=1754855117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/9790821fde97c98a82ca7426ae91986b.webm?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/9790821fde97c98a82ca7426ae91986b.mp4?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/23459ab76eed3a4d40a41ebc50ff0d0b.webp?t=1754855117\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole bunch of <strong>accessories are unlockable</strong> (via chests or other challenges). Hint: Some will give you <strong>advantages</strong> that shouldn't be overlooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/c6c7979b4e411d31eaf19ade7711ffe9.poster.avif?t=1754855117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/c6c7979b4e411d31eaf19ade7711ffe9.webm?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/c6c7979b4e411d31eaf19ade7711ffe9.mp4?t=1754855117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
